], targeting improvements in mitochondrial function through UA supplementation in combination with a potent altitude-induced training stimulus may be a novel strategy for athletes to improve performance outcomes, as the anti-inflammatory properties of UA may help facilitate post-exercise recovery for athletes training in these environmental conditions. Therefore, in the current study, we tested the hypothesis that supplementation with 1000 mg·day
