UA for 4 weeks would enhance recovery through decreases in inflammation and indirect markers of muscle damage while improving mitochondrial function. Such adaptations would be expected to enhance endurance running performance compared to athletes consuming a placebo (PL) and undertaking the same training regimen during an intensified training camp at low to moderate altitude.
